# ld-decode 1e8f04a. 240556032 bytes, 117459 EFM sectors; 92902 listed bad,
# all before the filesystem (140) or in free space (92762). Complete, not
# bit-perfect (vfs.accept: single-source): 102 sectors the filesystem needs
# were recovered by one set alone, 68 by DS1 and 34 by DS2; each passed the
# EFM decoder's error correction, and the two sets agree wherever both
# recovered a sector.
